              "text": "{\n  \"title\": \"Create Your First HTML/CSS Project\",\n  \"summary\": \"This tutorial shows how to build your first HTML and CSS website locally on your computer. You will set up project folders, structure an HTML page, link an external stylesheet using relative paths, and apply CSS styles to elements.\",\n  \"chapters\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Overview\",\n      \"start\": 0,\n      \"end\": 121\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Setup\",\n      \"start\": 121,\n      \"end\": 332\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"start\": 332,\n      \"end\": 644\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"start\": 644,\n      \"end\": 1078\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Conclusion\",\n      \"start\": 1078,\n      \"end\": 1156\n    }\n  ],\n  \"segments\": [\n    {\n      \"start\": 0,\n      \"end\": 121,\n      \"chapter\": \"Overview\",\n      \"action\": \"Brendan introduces the video, going over the learning goals and what will be built in this tutorial.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 121,\n      \"end\": 245,\n      \"chapter\": \"Setup\",\n      \"action\": \"Creates the project folder 'DevProject' inside the 'Codecademy' directory on the computer.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 245,\n      \"end\": 299,\n      \"chapter\": \"Setup\",\n      \"action\": \"Opens VS Code, opens the 'DevProject' directory, creates index.html, resources folder, css subfolder, index.css, and images subfolder.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.css\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 299,\n      \"end\": 332,\n      \"chapter\": \"Setup\",\n      \"action\": \"Copies the 'better_than_drake.png' image file from Downloads into resources/images directory.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 332,\n      \"end\": 498,\n      \"chapter\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"action\": \"Generates the HTML5 boilerplate in index.html using VS Code abbreviation and sets the page title to 'Gritt-ify'.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\\\n<head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\\\n    <meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"ie=edge\\\">\\\\n    <title>Gritt-ify</title>\\\\n</head>\\\\n<body>\\\\n    \\\\n</body>\\\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 498,\n      \"end\": 509,\n      \"chapter\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"action\": \"Adds the HTML banner section markup including a heading, image tag, paragraph, and button inside a div.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\\\n<head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\\\n    <meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"ie=edge\\\">\\\\n    <title>Gritt-ify</title>\\\\n</head>\\\\n<body>\\\\n    <!-- Banner section -->\\\\n    <div>\\\\n        <h1>Gritty's landing banner</h1>\\\\n        <img src=\\\"\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\\\n        <p>Cause everything's better with Gritty's face on it.</p>\\\\n        <button>Subscribe to me or I'll eat you</button>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n</body>\\\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 509,\n      \"end\": 525,\n      \"chapter\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"action\": \"Adds the Gritter section structure containing a span for the section title, social description, form, and post list.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\\\n<head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\\\n    <meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"ie=edge\\\">\\\\n    <title>Gritt-ify</title>\\\\n</head>\\\\n<body>\\\\n    <!-- Banner section -->\\\\n    <div>\\\\n        <h1>Gritty's landing banner</h1>\\\\n        <img src=\\\"\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\\\n        <p>Cause everything's better with Gritty's face on it.</p>\\\\n        <button>Subscribe to me or I'll eat you</button>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n\\\\n    <!-- Gritter section -->\\\\n    <div>\\\\n        <span>Gritter</span>\\\\n        <p>Social media dedicated to Gritty... and only Gritty... cause he's a psycho.</p>\\\\n        <form action=\\\"\\\">\\\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\">\\\\n            <input type=\\\"submit\\\" value=\\\"Submit\\\">\\\\n        </form>\\\\n        <ul>\\\\n            <li>\\\\n                <div><div><span>Hey there, it's Gritty again.</span></div></div>\\\\n            </li>\\\\n        </ul>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n</body>\\\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 525,\n      \"end\": 576,\n      \"chapter\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"action\": \"Links the image using a relative path to resources/images/better_than_drake.png inside index.html.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\\\n<head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\\\n    <meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"ie=edge\\\">\\\\n    <title>Gritt-ify</title>\\\\n</head>\\\\n<body>\\\\n    <!-- Banner section -->\\\\n    <div>\\\\n        <h1>Gritty's landing banner</h1>\\\\n        <img src=\\\"./resources/images/better_than_drake.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\\\n        <p>Cause everything's better with Gritty's face on it.</p>\\\\n        <button>Subscribe to me or I'll eat you</button>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n\\\\n    <!-- Gritter section -->\\\\n    <div>\\\\n        <span>Gritter</span>\\\\n        <p>Social media dedicated to Gritty... and only Gritty... cause he's a psycho.</p>\\\\n        <form action=\\\"\\\">\\\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\">\\\\n            <input type=\\\"submit\\\" value=\\\"Submit\\\">\\\\n        </form>\\\\n        <ul>\\\\n            <li>\\\\n                <div><div><span>Hey there, it's Gritty again.</span></div></div>\\\\n            </li>\\\\n        </ul>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n</body>\\\\n</html>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 576,\n      \"end\": 611,\n      \"chapter\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"action\": \"Opens the unstyled HTML page in Chrome browser to check the rendered content.\",\n      \"file\": \"\",\n      \"code\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 611,\n      \"end\": 644,\n      \"chapter\": \"Create HTML Document\",\n      \"action\": \"Updates the post list items in index.html with distinct messages from Gritty.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"        <ul>\\\\n            <li>\\\\n                <div><div><span>Hey there, it's Gritty again.</span></div></div>\\\\n            </li>\\\\n            <li>\\\\n                <div><div><span>I haven't eaten any other mascots since yesterday.</span></div></div>\\\\n            </li>\\\\n            <li>\\\\n                <div><div><span>Burp.</span></div></div>\\\\n            </li>\\\\n        </ul>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 644,\n      \"end\": 724,\n      \"chapter\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"action\": \"Adds class 'banner' to the banner div in index.html, then defines styling for .banner in index.css.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.css\",\n      \"code\": \".banner {\\\\n    background-color: #4D00FF;\\\\n    color: white;\\\\n    margin-top: 75px;\\\\n    text-align: center;\\\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 724,\n      \"end\": 778,\n      \"chapter\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"action\": \"Links index.css to index.html using a relative path inside the head section and refreshes the browser.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n      \"code\": \"<head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\\\n    <meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"ie=edge\\\">\\\\n    <title>Gritt-ify</title>\\\\n    <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"./resources/css/index.css\\\">\\\\n</head>\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 778,\n      \"end\": 865,\n      \"chapter\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"action\": \"Assigns ID 'small-gritty' to the banner image in index.html and sets its height and width to 100px in index.css.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.css\",\n      \"code\": \".banner {\\\\n    background-color: #4D00FF;\\\\n    color: white;\\\\n    margin-top: 75px;\\\\n    text-align: center;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n#small-gritty {\\\\n    height: 100px;\\\\n    width: 100px;\\\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 865,\n      \"end\": 955,\n      \"chapter\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"action\": \"Adds top/bottom padding of 100px to .banner in index.css to give space around the content.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.css\",\n      \"code\": \".banner {\\\\n    background-color: #4D00FF;\\\\n    color: white;\\\\n    margin-top: 75px;\\\\n    text-align: center;\\\\n    padding: 100px 0;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n#small-gritty {\\\\n    height: 100px;\\\\n    width: 100px;\\\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 955,\n      \"end\": 1003,\n      \"chapter\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"action\": \"Gives ID 'gritter' to the Gritter title span and styles it with blue color and 100px font-size in index.css.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.css\",\n      \"code\": \"#gritter {\\\\n    color: #4D00FF;\\\\n    font-size: 100px;\\\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1003,\n      \"end\": 1078,\n      \"chapter\": \"Basic Style Sheets\",\n      \"action\": \"Creates a reusable .bold class in index.css and applies it to elements in index.html.\",\n      \"file\": \"index.css\",\n      \"code\": \".bold {\\\\n    font-weight: 900;\\\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"start\": 1078,\n  